will get to know about this in a moment.
Finally, the fifth operation is modulus.

86
00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:29.000
It is represented with the help of
percentage symbol.

87
00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:34.000
With the help of this symbol, we would
be able to divide two numbers and we

88
00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:40.000
will get the remainder as the result.
For example, if we divide 10 by 3, we

89
00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:45.000
will get one as the remainder. So in
this case, we will get one as the

90
00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:51.000
result. I hope this is clear to you.
So these are all the binary arithmetic

91
