xt": "But soon,"}, {"start": 316.0, "end": 319.0, "text": "in the decade 1990s,"}, {"start": 319.0, "end": 323.0, "text": "researchers shifted their focus"}, {"start": 323.0, "end": 325.0, "text": "on statistical machine learning"}, {"start": 325.0, "end": 326.0, "text": "techniques."}, {"start": 326.0, "end": 329.0, "text": "Till now, the focus was on mimicking"}, {"start": 329.0, "end": 331.0, "text": "human-like intelligence into the"}, {"start": 331.0, "end": 335.0, "text": "machines. But now, the focus was shifted"}, {"start": 335.0, "end": 338.0, "text": "towards statistics, mathematics, and"}, {"start": 338.0, "end": 340.0, "text": "probability,"}, {"start": 340.0, "end": 342.0, "text": "which included the problems like"}, {"start": 342.0, "end": 345.0, "text": "predicting the house prices using the"}, {"start": 345.0, "end": 349.0, "text": "features floor space, rooms, lot sizes,"}, {"start": 349.0, "end": 350.0, "text": "etc."}, {"start": 350.0, "end": 354.0, "text": "And many other problems like this."}, {"start": 354.0, "end": 356.0, "text": "Many machine learning algorithms that we"}, {"start": 356.0, "end": 361.0, "text": "study today emerged during this period."}, {"start": 361.0, "end": 364.0, "text": "After that, in the decade 2000s, the"}, {"start": 364.0, "end": 367.0, "text": "growth of internet was seen."}, {"start": 367.0, "end": 370.0, "text": "Lots of data was generated."}, {"start": 370.0, "end": 373.0, "text": "And due to this, many big companies"}, {"start": 373.0, "end": 375.0, "text": "started collecting and storing that"}, {"start": 375.0, "end": 376.0, "text": "data."}, {"start": 376.0, "end": 378.0, "text": "Due to the abundance of data created,"}, {"start": 378.0, "end": 382.0, "text": "this era is called as the big data era."}, {"start": 382.0, "end": 385.0, "text": "And this created the opportunities for"}, {"start": 385.0, "end": 387.0, "text": "machine learning algorithms, because"}, {"start": 387.0, "end": 389.0, "text": "data is the main source of machine"}, {"start": 389.0, "end": 391.0, "text": "learning."}, {"start": 391.0, "end": 395.0, "text": "After that, in the decade 2010s,"}, {"start": 395.0, "end": 397.0, "text": "the artificial neural networks and the"}, {"start": 397.0, "end": 400.0, "text": "modern neural networks started gaining"}, {"start": 400.0, "end": 403.0, "text": "the remarkable success in the field of"}, {"start": 403.0, "end": 406.0, "text": "speech recognition, image processing,"}, {"start": 406.0, "end": 409.0, "text": "translations, and many other tasks,"}, {"start": 409.0, "end": 412.0, "text": "which triggered the deep learning"}, {"start": 412.0, "end": 413.0, "text": "revolution."}, {"start": 413.0, "end": 417.0, "text": "And if I talk about the present times,"}, {"start": 417.0, "end": 419.0, "text": "we have entered into the modern AI"}, {"start": 419.0, "end": 420.0, "text": "world."}, {"start": 420.0, "end": 423.0, "text": "Technologies like social robots,"}, {"start": 423.0, "end": 425.0, "text": "recommendation systems, prediction"}, {"start": 425.0, "end": 429.0, "text": "systems, navigation systems, driverless"}, {"start": 429.0, "end": 432.0, "text": "vehicles are all results of this"}, {"start": 432.0, "end": 434.0, "text": "research and development that was"}, {"start": 434.0, "end": 437.0, "text": "carried out over the last few decades."}, {"start": 437.0, "end": 440.0, "text": "So, this is the history of artificial"}, {"start": 440.0, "end": 443.0, "text": "intelligence and machine learning."}, {"start": 443.0, "end": 447.0, "text": "One step taken in the year 1943"}, {"start": 447.0, "end": 450.0, "text": "has gradually evolved into something"}, {"start": 450.0, "end": 453.0, "text": "amazing that we are experiencing today."}, {"start": 453.0, "end": 455.0, "text": "So, in this way, we are done with our"}, {"start": 455.0, "end": 459.0, "text": "topic, history of machine learning."}, {"start": 459.0, "end": 462.0, "text": "I hope you have learned many new things"}, {"start": 462.0, "end": 463.0, "text": "today."}, {"start": 463.0, "end": 465.0, "text": "So, this was all from my side for this"}, {"start": 465.0, "end": 468.0, "text": "lecture. Thank you, and I''ll see you in"}, {"start": 468.0, "end": 472.0, "text": "the next lecture."}, {"start": 472.0, "end": 477.0, "text": ">> [music]"}]'::jsonb, 'WEBVTT

