 will understand what is linear"}, {"start": 452.0, "end": 454.0, "text": "regression algorithm in detail in our"}, {"start": 454.0, "end": 457.0, "text": "second chapter. For now just keep in"}, {"start": 457.0, "end": 460.0, "text": "mind that this model is trained on"}, {"start": 460.0, "end": 463.0, "text": "linear regression algorithm. By this we"}, {"start": 463.0, "end": 466.0, "text": "have created our machine learning model."}, {"start": 466.0, "end": 468.0, "text": "Now we have our training data. We have"}, {"start": 468.0, "end": 470.0, "text": "our machine learning model. So the next"}, {"start": 470.0, "end": 472.0, "text": "step is to train this machine learning"}, {"start": 472.0, "end": 475.0, "text": "model using this training data. So as"}, {"start": 475.0, "end": 478.0, "text": "you can see we have written model.fit"}, {"start": 478.0, "end": 483.0, "text": "x y. Now what is x y? x y is the"}, {"start": 483.0, "end": 486.0, "text": "training data and model is our machine"}, {"start": 486.0, "end": 488.0, "text": "learning model that we have just"}, {"start": 488.0, "end": 491.0, "text": "created. So according to this line we"}, {"start": 491.0, "end": 494.0, "text": "are training our machine learning model"}, {"start": 494.0, "end": 497.0, "text": "using this training data. We are fitting"}, {"start": 497.0, "end": 499.0, "text": "the training data into our machine"}, {"start": 499.0, "end": 502.0, "text": "learning model. After this line, our"}, {"start": 502.0, "end": 504.0, "text": "machine learning model will be trained"}, {"start": 504.0, "end": 508.0, "text": "on this training data of house sizes and"}, {"start": 508.0, "end": 511.0, "text": "house prices. Now the next step is to"}, {"start": 511.0, "end": 514.0, "text": "predict the price for a new house. So"}, {"start": 514.0, "end": 518.0, "text": "here you can see I have taken 1,800 as"}, {"start": 518.0, "end": 521.0, "text": "the house size. In the training data, we"}, {"start": 521.0, "end": 524.0, "text": "are not able to see 1,800, which means"}, {"start": 524.0, "end": 528.0, "text": "1,800 is the size of a new house. Now,"}, {"start": 528.0, "end": 531.0, "text": "we want our model to predict the price"}, {"start": 531.0, "end": 536.0, "text": "of this new house having the size 1,800."}, {"start": 536.0, "end": 538.0, "text": "The resulting prediction of the house"}, {"start": 538.0, "end": 540.0, "text": "price will be stored inside the variable"}, {"start": 540.0, "end": 543.0, "text": "prediction. And finally, we are printing"}, {"start": 543.0, "end": 546.0, "text": "the prediction obtained by our model. So"}, {"start": 546.0, "end": 549.0, "text": "this is the basic working of our machine"}, {"start": 549.0, "end": 551.0, "text": "learning model for predicting the house"}, {"start": 551.0, "end": 555.0, "text": "prices on the basis of house features. I"}, {"start": 555.0, "end": 557.0, "text": "know few things are left unclear to"}, {"start": 557.0, "end": 560.0, "text": "explain but the agenda was not to"}, {"start": 560.0, "end": 563.0, "text": "explain you each and every line of this"}, {"start": 563.0, "end": 565.0, "text": "code snippet. I just wanted you to have"}, {"start": 565.0, "end": 568.0, "text": "a look at how machine learning program"}, {"start": 568.0, "end": 571.0, "text": "looks like. So I hope now the machine"}, {"start": 571.0, "end": 573.0, "text": "learning model is very much clear to"}, {"start": 573.0, "end": 577.0, "text": "you. Now comes the most exciting part of"}, {"start": 577.0, "end": 578.0, "text": "this lecture, the practical"}, {"start": 578.0, "end": 580.0, "text": "demonstration of our machine learning"}, {"start": 580.0, "end": 583.0, "text": "model in which we will train our own"}, {"start": 583.0, "end": 586.0, "text": "machine learning model to classify the"}, {"start": 586.0, "end": 589.0, "text": "images of cats and dogs. So let''s come"}, {"start": 589.0, "end": 592.0, "text": "to my computer s