 can be some"}, {"start": 323.0, "end": 325.0, "text": "irrelevant columns. There can be some"}, {"start": 325.0, "end": 329.0, "text": "missing values. So, all such problems"}, {"start": 329.0, "end": 331.0, "text": "are handled in this particular step,"}, {"start": 331.0, "end": 333.0, "text": "that is basic data cleaning. For"}, {"start": 333.0, "end": 336.0, "text": "example, in case of house price data"}, {"start": 336.0, "end": 339.0, "text": "set, there is a column called as house"}, {"start": 339.0, "end": 342.0, "text": "size. Now, if that column contains some"}, {"start": 342.0, "end": 345.0, "text": "negative values, then it is an error"}, {"start": 345.0, "end": 346.0, "text": "because size of the house can never be"}, {"start": 346.0, "end": 347.0, "text": "negative."}, {"start": 347.0, "end": 349.0, "text": "Also, there can be some missing values"}, {"start": 349.0, "end": 351.0, "text": "in that data set. There can be some"}, {"start": 351.0, "end": 354.0, "text": "spelling mistakes. There can be some"}, {"start": 354.0, "end": 357.0, "text": "unformatted text. All these problems are"}, {"start": 357.0, "end": 360.0, "text": "removed in basic data cleaning."}, {"start": 360.0, "end": 362.0, "text": "Now, after basic data cleaning, the"}, {"start": 362.0, "end": 366.0, "text": "fourth step is data splitting."}, {"start": 366.0, "end": 368.0, "text": "In the previous lectures, I have already"}, {"start": 368.0, "end": 370.0, "text": "explained you very well the meaning of"}, {"start": 370.0, "end": 372.0, "text": "data splitting."}, {"start": 372.0, "end": 375.0, "text": "Data splitting, or we can say train test"}, {"start": 375.0, "end": 378.0, "text": "split, is the process of dividing the"}, {"start": 378.0, "end": 382.0, "text": "total available data into two parts."}, {"start": 382.0, "end": 384.0, "text": "The first part is the training data. The"}, {"start": 384.0, "end": 387.0, "text": "second part is the testing data."}, {"start": 387.0, "end": 389.0, "text": "Training data is used by the machine"}, {"start": 389.0, "end": 391.0, "text": "learning model to learn patterns and"}, {"start": 391.0, "end": 392.0, "text": "features."}, {"start": 392.0, "end": 395.0, "text": "And testing data is used to evaluate the"}, {"start": 395.0, "end": 396.0, "text": "performance of the machine learning"}, {"start": 396.0, "end": 400.0, "text": "model because it is an unseen data."}, {"start": 400.0, "end": 403.0, "text": "Now, the training data is usually larger"}, {"start": 403.0, "end": 405.0, "text": "than the testing data."}, {"start": 405.0, "end": 405.0, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 405.0, "end": 407.0, "text": "Because training data is used by the"}, {"start": 407.0, "end": 409.0, "text": "machine learning model to learn patterns"}, {"start": 409.0, "end": 412.0, "text": "and features. That is why it is required"}, {"start": 412.0, "end": 414.0, "text": "by machine learning model in larger"}, {"start": 414.0, "end": 416.0, "text": "amounts."}, {"start": 416.0, "end": 418.0, "text": "But, testing data is used to evaluate"}, {"start": 418.0, "end": 420.0, "text": "the performance of the machine learning"}, {"start": 420.0, "end": 423.0, "text": "model. That is why it can be less."}, {"start": 423.0, "end": 4820.0, "text": "So, the standard data splitting ratio is"}, {"start": 4820.0, "end": 428.0, "text": "."}, {"start": 428.0, "end": 431.0, "text": "That means 80% of the total available"}, {"start": 431.0, "end": 434.0, "text": "data is training data, and 20% of the"}, {"start": 434.0, "end": 437.0, "text": "total available data is used as testing"}, {"start": 437.0, "end": 439.0, "text": "data."}, {"start": 439.0, "end": 441.0, "text": "Now, there is a one important point that"}, {"start": 441.0, "end": 443.0, "text": "you should note."}, {"start": 443.0, "end": 445.0, "text": "Before performing the data splitting,"}, {"start": 445.0, "end": 448.0, "text": "that is, before dividing the data into"}, {"start": 448.0, "end": 451.0, "text": "training data and testing data, we must"}, {"start": 451.0, "end": 454.0, "text": "first separate the features and labels."}, {"start": 454.0, "end": 457.0, "text": "For example, in case of house price data"}, {"start": 457.0, "end": 460.0, "text": "set, we must separate the house details"}, {"start": 460.0, "end": 462.0, "text": "from the house price."}, {"start": 462.0, "end": 465.0, "text": "So, the house details like size of the"}, {"start": 465.0, "end": 467.0, "text": "house, age of the house, number of"}, {"start": 467.0, "end": 469.0, "text": "bedrooms of the house, location of the"}, {"start": 469.0, "end": 472.0, "text": "house must be separated from the actual"}, {"start": 472.0, "end": 474.0, "text": "price of the house."}, {"start": 474.0, "end": 477.0, "text": "Only after that we can perform data"}, {"start": 477.0, "end": 479.0, "text": "splitting, that is dividing the data"}, {"start": 479.0, "end": 483.0, "text": "into training data and testing data."}, {"start": 483.0, "end": 485.0, "text": "So, I hope data splitting is now clear"}, {"start": 485.0, "end": 486.0, "text": "to you."}, {"start": 486.0, "end": 490.0, "text": "After that, the fifth step is data"}, {"start": 490.0, "end": 493.0, "text": "preprocessing and feature engineering."}, {"start": 493.0, "end": 496.0, "text": "So, after data splitting, we need to"}, {"start": 496.0, "end": 498.0, "text": "prepare the data. Now, data preparation"}, {"start": 498.0, "end": 502.0, "text": "includes data preprocessing and feature"}, {"start": 502.0, "end": 505.0, "text": "engineering. Let''s first talk about what"}, {"start": 505.0, "end": 507.0, "text": "is data preprocessing."}, {"start": 507.0, "end": 509.0, "text": "Data preprocessing is the process of"}, {"start": 509.0, "end": 512.0, "text": "converting the data into a format that"}, {"start": 512.0, "end": 514.0, "text": "machine learning algorithm can"}, {"start": 514.0, "end": 515.0, "text": "understand."}, {"start": 515.0, "end": 519.0, "text": "So, in data preprocessing, we convert"}, {"start": 519.0, "end": 521.0, "text": "our data into a format that is"}, {"start": 521.0, "end": 523.0, "text": "understandable by machine learning"}, {"start": 523.0, "end": 526.0, "text": "algorithm. For example, a machine"}, {"start": 526.0, "end": 529.0, "text": "learning algorithm understands numeric"}, {"start": 529.0, "end": 532.0, "text": "data better than textual data."}, {"start": 532.0, "end": 534.0, "text": "Now, suppose there is a column in a data"}, {"start": 534.0, "end": 537.0, "text": "set known as location, which contains"}, {"start": 537.0, "end": 541.0, "text": "the values like Chennai, Mumbai, Agra,"}, {"start": 541.0, "end": 542.0, "text": "and so on."}, {"start": 542.0, "end": 545.0, "text": "Now, these textual values needs to be"}, {"start": 545.0, "end": 548.0, "text": "converted into numerical values, so that"}, {"start": 548.0, "end": 550.0, "text": "our machine learning algorithm can"}, {"start": 550.0, "end": 551.0, "text": "understand them."}, {"start": 551.0, "end": 554.0, "text": "This is one of the examples of data"}, {"start": 554.0, "end": 557.0, "text": "preprocessing. But, data preprocessing"}, {"start": 557.0, "end": 559.0, "text": "is a very vast field."}, {"start": 559.0, "end": 563.0, "text": "It includes categorical encoding,"}, {"start": 563.0, "end": 565.0, "text": "handling missing values, handling"}, {"start": 565.0, "end": 568.0, "text": "outliers, feature scaling, data"}, {"start": 568.0, "end": 570.0, "text": "transformation, and so on."}, {"start": 570.0, "end": 573.0, "text": "Don''t worry, I will explain you each of"}, {"start": 573.0, "end": 575.0, "text": "these terms when we will understand data"}, {"start": 575.0, "end": 578.0, "text": "preprocessing in details."}, {"start": 578.0, "end": 580.0, "text": "Now, the second one is feature"}, {"start": 580.0, "end": 582.0, "text": "engineering."}, {"start": 582.0, "end": 584.0, "text": "What is feature engineering?"}, {"start": 584.0, "end": 586.0, "text": "It is the process of creating new"}, {"start": 586.0, "end": 589.0, "text": "features from the existing features."}, {"start": 589.0, "end": 591.0, "text": "For example, there is a data set which"}, {"start": 591.0, "end": 593.0, "text": "contains a column known as date of"}, {"start": 593.0, "end": 594.0, "text": "birth."}, {"start": 594.0, "end": 597.0, "text": "Now, if we create a new column called as"}, {"start": 597.0, "end": 600.0, "text": "age from date of birth, then this is"}, {"start": 600.0, "end": 602.0, "text": "known as feature engineering."}, {"start": 602.0, "end": 605.0, "text": "Obviously, age can be easily derived"}, {"start": 605.0, "end": 607.0, "text": "from date of birth. So, we have created"}, {"start": 607.0, "end": 609.0, "text": "a new feature that is age from the"}, {"start": 609.0, "end": 612.0, "text": "existing feature that is date of birth."}, {"start": 612.0, "end": 614.0, "text": "So, this is feature engineering."}, {"start": 614.0, "end": 615.0, "text": "And why feature engineering is"}, {"start": 615.0, "end": 617.0, "text": "important?"}, {"start": 617.0, "end": 618.0, "text": "Because it makes the data more"}, {"start": 618.0, "end": 620.0, "text": "meaningful for the machine learning"}, {"start": 620.0, "end": 622.0, "text": "algorithm."}, {"start": 622.0, "end": 623.0, "text": "So, now I hope you have a basic"}, {"start": 623.0, "end": 626.0, "text": "understanding about data pre-processing"}, {"start": 626.0, "end": 628.0, "text": "and feature engineering."}, {"start": 628.0, "end": 631.0, "text": "After that, the sixth step is selecting"}, {"start": 631.0, "end": 634.0, "text": "algorithm. That means we need to select"}, {"start": 634.0, "end": 636.0, "text": "an appropriate machine learning"}, {"start": 636.0, "end": 638.0, "text": "algorithm for the machine learning"}, {"start": 638.0, "end": 639.0, "text": "model."}, {"start": 639.0, "end": 640.0, "text": "So, what is a machine learning"}, {"start": 640.0, "end": 642.0, "text": "algorithm?"}, {"start": 642.0, "end": 645.0, "text": "Machine learning algorithm is the method"}, {"start": 645.0, "end": 647.0, "text": "or approach used by machine learning"}, {"start": 647.0, "end": 650.0, "text": "model to learn patterns from the data."}, {"start": 650.0, "end": 652.0, "text": "I have explained you that machine"}, {"start": 652.0, "end": 655.0, "text": "learning model learns patterns and"}, {"start": 655.0, "end": 657.0, "text": "features from the data."}, {"start": 657.0, "end": 659.0, "text": "So, the approach or method used by the"}, {"start": 659.0, "end": 661.0, "text": "machine learning model to learn patterns"}, {"start": 661.0, "end": 664.0, "text": "from the data, that approach or method"}, {"start": 664.0, "end": 667.0, "text": "is known as machine learning algorithm."}, {"start": 667.0, "end": 669.0, "text": "Now, the choice of machine learning"}, {"start": 669.0, "end": 671.0, "text": "algorithm depends on the type of"}, {"start": 671.0, "end": 673.0, "text": "problem."}, {"start": 673.0, "end": 675.0, "text": "For example, in case of house price"}, {"start": 675.0, "end": 676.0, "text": "prediction,"}, {"start": 676.0, "end": 678.0, "text": "we need to predict the prices of the"}, {"start": 678.0, "end": 682.0, "text": "houses, and price is a numerical value."}, {"start": 682.0, "end": 684.0, "text": "That is why we choose a regression"}, {"start": 684.0, "end": 687.0, "text": "algorithm like linear regression."}, {"start": 687.0, "end": 688.0, "text": "If we choose a wrong machine learning"}, {"start": 688.0, "end": 691.0, "text": "algorithm, the machine learning model"}, {"start": 691.0, "end": 693.0, "text": "will give poor results"}, {"start": 693.0, "end": 695.0, "text": "even if the quality of data is very"}, {"start": 695.0, "end": 696.0, "text": "nice."}, {"start": 696.0, "end": 698.0, "text": "So, this was the step number six, that"}, {"start": 698.0, "end": 700.0, "text": "is selecting a machine learning"}, {"start": 700.0, "end": 701.0, "text": "algorithm."}, {"start": 701.0, "end": 703.0, "text": "So, till now we have defined the problem"}, {"start": 703.0, "end": 707.0, "text": "statement, we have collected the data,"}, {"start": 707.0, "end": 709.0, "text": "we have applied basic data cleaning,"}, {"start": 709.0, "end": 711.0, "text": "after that we have splitted the data"}, {"start": 711.0, "end": 714.0, "text": "into two parts, training and testing."}, {"start": 714.0, "end": 716.0, "text": "After that we have prepared the data,"}, {"start": 716.0, "end": 718.0, "text": "that is data pre-processing and feature"}, {"start": 718.0, "end": 720.0, "text": "engineering. And after that we have"}, {"start": 720.0, "end": 723.0, "text": "selected an appropriate machine learning"}, {"start": 723.0, "end": 724.0, "text": "algorithm."}, {"start": 724.0, "end": 726.0, "text": "Now, it''s time to train the machine"}, {"start": 726.0, "end": 729.0, "text": "learning model. So, the seventh step is"}, {"start": 729.0, "end": 732.0, "text": "model training. In this step, the"}, {"start": 732.0, "end": 734.0, "text": "machine learning model learns the"}, {"start": 734.0, "end": 737.0, "text": "patterns and features from the data."}, {"start": 737.0, "end": 739.0, "text": "Machine learning model learns the"}, {"start": 739.0, "end": 741.0, "text": "relationships between the feature and"}, {"start": 741.0, "end": 743.0, "text": "target variable."}, {"start": 743.0, "end": 745.0, "text": "For example, in a house price prediction"}, {"start": 745.0, "end": 748.0, "text": "system, the linear regression model will"}, {"start": 748.0, "end": 751.0, "text": "try to identify the relationships"}, {"start": 751.0, "end": 753.0, "text": "between the house features and the house"}, {"start": 753.0, "end": 756.0, "text": "price. For example, if the size of the"}, {"start": 756.0, "end": 759.0, "text": "house is bigger, the price would be"}, {"start": 759.0, "end": 761.0, "text": "higher. If the location of the house is"}, {"start": 761.0, "end": 764.0, "text": "better, the price would be higher. Like"}, {"start": 764.0, "end": 766.0, "text": "this. So, this is known as model"}, {"start": 766.0, "end": 769.0, "text": "training. Now, after model training, the"}, {"start": 769.0, "end": 773.0, "text": "eighth step is model evaluation and"}, {"start": 773.0, "end": 775.0, "text": "pipeline saving."}, {"start": 775.0, "end": 777.0, "text": "So, what is model evaluation?"}, {"start": 777.0, "end": 780.0, "text": "Model evaluation means model testing."}, {"start": 780.0, "end": 783.0, "text": "That means, after training the machine"}, {"start": 783.0, "end": 786.0, "text": "learning model, we test the performance"}, {"start": 786.0, "end": 788.0, "text": "of the machine learning model on unseen"}, {"start": 788.0, "end": 789.0, "text": "data."}, {"start": 789.0, "end": 792.0, "text": "In this way, we evaluate our machine"}, {"start": 792.0, "end": 794.0, "text": "learning model, how well it is trained"}, {"start": 794.0, "end": 797.0, "text": "on the training data set. So, model"}, {"start": 797.0, "end": 799.0, "text": "training is done on the training data"}, {"start": 799.0, "end": 802.0, "text": "set and model evaluation, or we can say"}, {"start": 802.0, "end": 805.0, "text": "model testing, is done on the testing"}, {"start": 805.0, "end": 807.0, "text": "data set, which is unseen for the"}, {"start": 807.0, "end": 809.0, "text": "machine learning model."}, {"start": 809.0, "end": 812.0, "text": "Now, after model evaluation, there is"}, {"start": 812.0, "end": 815.0, "text": "pipeline saving. What is the meaning of"}, {"start": 815.0, "end": 817.0, "text": "pipeline saving?"}, {"start": 817.0, "end": 820.0, "text": "Now, after the model is evaluated, if it"}, {"start": 820.0, "end": 822.0, "text": "has a good performance, then we need to"}, {"start": 822.0, "end": 825.0, "text": "save the machine learning model."}, {"start": 825.0, "end": 827.0, "text": "Why to save the machine learning model?"}, {"start": 827.0, "end": 829.0, "text": "So that we don''t need to retrain the"}, {"start": 829.0, "end": 832.0, "text": "machine learning model again and again"}, {"start": 832.0, "end": 833.0, "text": "from the beginning."}, {"start": 833.0, "end": 835.0, "text": "This is known as saving a machine"}, {"start": 835.0, "end": 838.0, "text": "learning model, or I can also say saving"}, {"start": 838.0, "end": 842.0, "text": "the entire pipeline of machine learning."}, {"start": 842.0, "end": 844.0, "text": "Now, after model evaluation and pipeline"}, {"start": 844.0, "end": 847.0, "text": "saving, the ninth step is making"}, {"start": 847.0, "end": 849.0, "text": "predictions."}, {"start": 849.0, "end": 852.0, "text": "That means the trained, tested, and"}, {"start": 852.0, "end": 855.0, "text": "saved model is now used to make"}, {"start": 855.0, "end": 858.0, "text": "predictions on new data."}, {"start": 858.0, "end": 860.0, "text": "And this is the actual practical use"}, {"start": 860.0, "end": 863.0, "text": "case of machine learning. All this we"}, {"start": 863.0, "end": 866.0, "text": "are doing just to ensure that we will"}, {"start": 866.0, "end": 868.0, "text": "make predictions on the new data."}, {"start": 868.0, "end": 871.0, "text": "Suppose a user enters the details like"}, {"start": 871.0, "end": 873.0, "text": "size of the house, location of the"}, {"start": 873.0, "end": 876.0, "text": "house, age of the house, number of"}, {"start": 876.0, "end": 879.0, "text": "bedrooms of the house, and so on. And"}, {"start": 879.0, "end": 882.0, "text": "model predicts the price of the house."}, {"start": 882.0, "end": 885.0, "text": "This is known as making predictions on"}, {"start": 885.0, "end": 888.0, "text": "new data. And this is the actual use"}, {"start": 888.0, "end": 890.0, "text": "case of machine learning."}, {"start": 890.0, "end": 893.0, "text": "Now, after making predictions, the last"}, {"start": 893.0, "end": 896.0, "text": "step is monitor and iterate."}, {"start": 896.0, "end": 898.0, "text": "What is the meaning of monitor and"}, {"start": 898.0, "end": 899.0, "text": "iterate?"}, {"start": 899.0, "end": 901.0, "text": "It is to be noted that this machine"}, {"start": 901.0, "end": 904.0, "text": "learning pipeline does not end after"}, {"start": 904.0, "end": 906.0, "text": "making predictions."}, {"start": 906.0, "end": 909.0, "text": "After making predictions, we need to"}, {"start": 909.0, "end": 911.0, "text": "keep on checking the performance of the"}, {"start": 911.0, "end": 913.0, "text": "machine learning model over the regular"}, {"start": 913.0, "end": 915.0, "text": "intervals of time."}, {"start": 915.0, "end": 918.0, "text": "So that we can check whether the machine"}, {"start": 918.0, "end": 920.0, "text": "learning model is still performing good"}, {"start": 920.0, "end": 922.0, "text": "or not."}, {"start": 922.0, "end": 925.0, "text": "This is known as monitoring of a machine"}, {"start": 925.0, "end": 926.0, "text": "learning model."}, {"start": 926.0, "end": 929.0, "text": "And what is the meaning of iterate?"}, {"start": 929.0, "end": 932.0, "text": "Iterate means to continuously improve"}, {"start": 932.0, "end": 933.0, "text": "the performance of the machine learning"}, {"start": 933.0, "end": 934.0, "text": "model."}, {"start": 934.0, "end": 938.0, "text": "For example, the house prices may change"}, {"start": 938.0, "end": 939.0, "text": "after few months."}, {"start": 939.0, "end": 941.0, "text": "That is why we need to collect the new"}, {"start": 941.0, "end": 943.0, "text": "data, then we need to retrain the"}, {"start": 943.0, "end": 945.0, "text": "machine learning model."}, {"start": 945.0, "end": 949.0, "text": "This process is known as iteration. So,"}, {"start": 949.0, "end": 952.0, "text": "monitor and iterate means keep on"}, {"start": 952.0, "end": 953.0, "text": "checking the performance of the machine"}, {"start": 953.0, "end": 956.0, "text": "learning model and improving it wherever"}, {"start": 956.0, "end": 958.0, "text": "required."}, {"start": 958.0, "end": 960.0, "text": "So, this is the entire machine learning"}, {"start": 960.0, "end": 963.0, "text": "pipeline that we have discussed."}, {"start": 963.0, "end": 965.0, "text": "First, we define the problem statement,"}, {"start": 965.0, "end": 968.0, "text": "then we collect the data, then we clean"}, {"start": 968.0, "end": 971.0, "text": "the data, after that we split the data"}, {"start": 971.0, "end": 973.0, "text": "into training and testing data,"}, {"start": 973.0, "end": 976.0, "text": "after that we prepare the data, that is"}, {"start": 976.0, "end": 977.0, "text": "data pre-processing and feature"}, {"start": 977.0, "end": 980.0, "text": "engineering. After that, we select an"}, {"start": 980.0, "end": 982.0, "text": "appropriate machine learning algorithm."}, {"start": 982.0, "end": 984.0, "text": "After that, we train the machine"}, {"start": 984.0, "end": 987.0, "text": "learning model, then we test and save"}, {"start": 987.0, "end": 989.0, "text": "the machine learning model. After that,"}, {"start": 989.0, "end": 991.0, "text": "we use the machine learning model to"}, {"start": 991.0, "end": 994.0, "text": "make predictions on new data, and we"}, {"start": 994.0, "end": 996.0, "text": "continuously monitor and iterate the"}, {"start": 996.0, "end": 998.0, "text": "performance of the machine learning"}, {"start": 998.0, "end": 999.0, "text": "model."}, {"start": 999.0, "end": 1002.0, "text": "In this way, we are done with our topic"}, {"start": 1002.0, "end": 1004.0, "text": "machine learning pipeline."}, {"start": 1004.0, "end": 1006.0, "text": "In the upcoming lectures, we will"}, {"start": 1006.0, "end": 1008.0, "text": "understand each of the steps of this ML"}, {"start": 1008.0, "end": 1011.0, "text": "pipeline in more details."}, {"start": 1011.0, "end": 1013.0, "text": "So, this was all from my side for this"}, {"start": 1013.0, "end": 1015.0, "text": "lecture. Thank you, and I''ll see you in"}, {"start": 1015.0, "end": 1019.0, "text": "the next lecture."}, {"start": 1019.0, "end": 1024.0, "text": ">> [music]"}]'::jsonb, 'WEBVTT

