ad pointer was \npointing to this particular node."}, {"start": 282.0, "end": 284.0, "text": "Now, it is pointing to this node."}, {"start": 284.0, "end": 287.0, "text": "This is the new node which has \nbeen added at the beginning of the list."}, {"start": 287.0, "end": 288.0, "text": "Isn''t that so?"}, {"start": 288.0, "end": 290.0, "text": "Is this operation tedious?"}, {"start": 290.0, "end": 292.0, "text": "No, not at all. This data structure is much efficient"}, {"start": 292.0, "end": 294.0, "text": "in adding data at the beginning of the list"}, {"start": 294.0, "end": 297.0, "text": "in comparison to the array. Isn''t that so?"}, {"start": 297.0, "end": 299.0, "text": "So, what is the conclusion?"}, {"start": 299.0, "end": 301.0, "text": "Inserting an element at the beginning of the list"}, {"start": 301.0, "end": 303.0, "text": "is way faster in the linked list than arrays."}, {"start": 303.0, "end": 306.0, "text": "If you want to add data at the beginning of the list,"}, {"start": 306.0, "end": 310.0, "text": "then it is much faster in the \ncase of linked list than arrays."}, {"start": 310.0, "end": 313.0, "text": "In this way, we can compare data structures"}, {"start": 313.0, "end": 316.0, "text": "and this will ultimately give \nthe idea to select the best"}, {"start": 316.0, "end": 319.0, "text": "possible data structure for a \nparticular operation. Right?"}, {"start": 319.0, "end": 321.0, "text": "Obviously, in this way we would be able to"}, {"start": 321.0, "end": 324.0, "text": "compare data structures and then we can select the"}, {"start": 324.0, "end": 326.0, "text": "best possible data structure \nfor a particular operation."}, {"start": 326.0, "end": 328.0, "text": "Here, we are performing an operation that is,"}, {"start": 328.0, "end": 330.0, "text": "adding the data at the beginning of the list."}, {"start": 330.0, "end": 332.0, "text": "It is clear that, linked list is performing"}, {"start": 332.0, "end": 334.0, "text": "better than array. Right?"}, {"start": 334.0, "end": 336.0, "text": "So definitely, we will choose linked list."}, {"start": 336.0, "end": 339.0, "text": "So, this way we can compare the data structures"}, {"start": 339.0, "end": 341.0, "text": "and this will ultimately give the best"}, {"start": 341.0, "end": 343.0, "text": "possible data structure \nfor a particular operation."}, {"start": 343.0, "end": 346.0, "text": "That is why, we are studying time complexity."}, {"start": 346.0, "end": 349.0, "text": "Because, with time complexity \nwe would be able to know"}, {"start": 349.0, "end": 352.0, "text": "that which operation on which \ndata structure will take less time."}, {"start": 352.0, "end": 354.0, "text": "In the subsequent lectures, we will learn"}, {"start": 354.0, "end": 358.0, "text": "more about the time complexity, \nhow to find the time complexity,"}, {"start": 358.0, "end": 360.0, "text": "how do we able to compare the data structures."}, {"start": 360.0, "end": 363.0, "text": "Obviously, the previous example \nwas a very simple example."}, {"start": 363.0, "end": 365.0, "text": "Sometimes it is difficult to understand"}, {"start": 365.0, "end": 368.0, "text": "which particular data structure is \nbetter than the other data structure."}, {"start": 368.0, "end": 370.0, "text": "That is why, studying time complexity"}, {"start": 370.0, "end": 373.0, "text": "is very important. This will help us in determining"}, {"start": 373.0, "end": 376.0, "text": "which data structure is better \nfor a particular operation."}, {"start": 376.0, "end": 379.0, "text": "Okay friends, this is it for now."}, {"start": 379.0, "end": 384.0, "text": "Thank you for watching this presentation."}]'::jsonb, 'WEBVTT

