SELECT si.id, '# Study Guide: Basics of Asymptotic Analysis (Part 1)

## Conceptual Overview
Explains data structure efficiency focusing on time vs space, defines time complexity, compares array vs linked list for adding at beginning, and introduces asymptotic analysis as a tool to choose the best data structure for an operation.

Definition of data structure and efficiency in time and space
Focus on time complexity over space complexity
Example comparing array vs. linked list for inserting at the beginning

## Key Terminology & Concepts
