eger. It can"}, {"start": 233.0, "end": 235.0, "text": "hold an integer."}, {"start": 235.0, "end": 237.0, "text": "Then we have this member function"}, {"start": 237.0, "end": 240.0, "text": "display. Its return type is void. It has"}, {"start": 240.0, "end": 243.0, "text": "the capability to display name and role"}, {"start": 243.0, "end": 246.0, "text": "number in a specific format on the"}, {"start": 246.0, "end": 249.0, "text": "screen."}, {"start": 249.0, "end": 251.0, "text": "So these are all the members of this"}, {"start": 251.0, "end": 253.0, "text": "class and these members are public"}, {"start": 253.0, "end": 255.0, "text": "members."}, {"start": 255.0, "end": 257.0, "text": "Therefore we can access these members"}, {"start": 257.0, "end": 261.0, "text": "even outside the class and we can access"}, {"start": 261.0, "end": 265.0, "text": "them through the object of this class."}, {"start": 265.0, "end": 267.0, "text": "Here is the demonstration for the same."}, {"start": 267.0, "end": 270.0, "text": "Inside the main function I have defined"}, {"start": 270.0, "end": 273.0, "text": "the object S1 of type student. This"}, {"start": 273.0, "end": 276.0, "text": "means I have defined object as one of"}, {"start": 276.0, "end": 280.0, "text": "class student. Now through this object"}, {"start": 280.0, "end": 283.0, "text": "we can access all the members of this"}, {"start": 283.0, "end": 285.0, "text": "class."}, {"start": 285.0, "end": 287.0, "text": "This can be done by specifying the name"}, {"start": 287.0, "end": 289.0, "text": "of the object followed by the dot"}, {"start": 289.0, "end": 292.0, "text": "operator and then the name of the member"}, {"start": 292.0, "end": 295.0, "text": "which we want to access. Here I am"}, {"start": 295.0, "end": 298.0, "text": "trying to provide this string Bob to"}, {"start": 298.0, "end": 300.0, "text": "this name variable which is the data"}, {"start": 300.0, "end": 304.0, "text": "member of this class. In the same way I"}, {"start": 304.0, "end": 307.0, "text": "am providing this value 101 to this role"}, {"start": 307.0, "end": 310.0, "text": "number variable which is also the data"}, {"start": 310.0, "end": 313.0, "text": "member of this class and I''m doing this"}, {"start": 313.0, "end": 317.0, "text": "with the help of the S1 object."}, {"start": 317.0, "end": 319.0, "text": "Here I''m calling the display function"}, {"start": 319.0, "end": 321.0, "text": "through the S1 object. As I''m calling"}, {"start": 321.0, "end": 324.0, "text": "this function through the S1 object,"}, {"start": 324.0, "end": 327.0, "text": "name will be replaced by Bob and RO"}, {"start": 327.0, "end": 332.0, "text": "number will be replaced by 101."}, {"start": 332.0, "end": 334.0, "text": "This is because these values are"}, {"start": 334.0, "end": 336.0, "text": "provided to these variables with the"}, {"start": 336.0, "end": 339.0, "text": "help of S1 object."}, {"start": 339.0, "end": 342.0, "text": "So if we call this function via the S1"}, {"start": 342.0, "end": 345.0, "text": "object then we would be able to see the"}, {"start": 345.0, "end": 349.0, "text": "output like this. We will see name as"}, {"start": 349.0, "end": 353.0, "text": "Bob and RO number as 101."}, {"start": 353.0, "end": 356.0, "text": "I hope this is clear to you. So this is"}, {"start": 356.0, "end": 359.0, "text": "the use of public access specifier. With"}, {"start": 359.0, "end": 362.0, "text": "the help of public access specifier, we"}, {"start": 362.0, "end": 365.0, "text": "can access members of the class from"}, {"start": 365.0, "end": 369.0, "text": "anywhere in the program. So with this we"}, {"start": 369.0, "end": 370.0, "text": "have understood the public access"}, {"start": 370.0, "end": 373.0, "text": "specifier. This means we are done with"}, {"start": 373.0, "end": 375.0, "text": "the second topic also. Now let''s move to"}, {"start": 375.0, "end": 377.0, "text": "the third topic to understand the"}, {"start": 377.0, "end": 380.0, "text": "private access specifier."}, {"start": 380.0, "end": 383.0, "text": "The private access specifier allows"}, {"start": 383.0, "end": 386.0, "text": "members to be accessed only within the"}, {"start": 386.0, "end": 388.0, "text": "class."}, {"start": 388.0, "end": 391.0, "text": "So if we put some members under the"}, {"start": 391.0, "end": 394.0, "text": "private access specifier, then those"}, {"start": 394.0, "end": 397.0, "text": "members are only accessible within the"}, {"start": 397.0, "end": 400.0, "text": "class. They are not accessible from"}, {"start": 400.0, "end": 402.0, "text": "outside the class. Even if we create an"}, {"start": 402.0, "end": 405.0, "text": "object of the class and through that"}, {"start": 405.0, "end": 408.0, "text": "object if we try to access the members"}, {"start": 408.0, "end": 410.0, "text": "that are private then we would not be"}, {"start": 410.0, "end": 413.0, "text": "able to do so."}, {"start": 413.0, "end": 417.0, "text": "Also by default members of a class are"}, {"start": 417.0, "end": 419.0, "text": "private. If we do not specify the"}, {"start": 419.0, "end": 421.0, "text": "private keyword then the members are"}, {"start": 421.0, "end": 424.0, "text": "treated as private. I hope this is"}, {"start": 424.0, "end": 427.0, "text": "clear. Now let''s take one example"}, {"start": 427.0, "end": 430.0, "text": "program to properly understand how to"}, {"start": 430.0, "end": 433.0, "text": "use the private access specifier in C++"}, {"start": 433.0, "end": 437.0, "text": "programs. Again I took the same class"}, {"start": 437.0, "end": 440.0, "text": "and this time name and role number are"}, {"start": 440.0, "end": 443.0, "text": "private members of this class and the"}, {"start": 443.0, "end": 446.0, "text": "only public member of this class is"}, {"start": 446.0, "end": 448.0, "text": "display. Inside the main function, I"}, {"start": 448.0, "end": 452.0, "text": "have created the object S1 of student."}, {"start": 452.0, "end": 454.0, "text": "And through this S1 object, I am trying"}, {"start": 454.0, "end": 456.0, "text": "to access name and role number which is"}, {"start": 456.0, "end": 458.0, "text": "not allowed because these are private"}, {"start": 458.0, "end": 461.0, "text": "members. Therefore, we will get error"}, {"start": 461.0, "end": 464.0, "text": "from the compiler."}, {"start": 464.0, "end": 466.0, "text": "Now, what if we want to provide values"}, {"start": 466.0, "end": 472.0, "text": "to these members via the S1 object and"}, {"start": 472.0, "end": 475.0, "text": "that two from the main function?"}, {"start": 475.0, "end": 479.0, "text": "This can be done by creating the member"}, {"start": 479.0, "end": 481.0, "text": "function that to a public member"}, {"start": 481.0, "end": 484.0, "text": "function and through that member"}, {"start": 484.0, "end": 486.0, "text": "function we can provide values to these"}, {"start": 486.0, "end": 489.0, "text": "private members. These private members"}, {"start": 489.0, "end": 492.0, "text": "are accessible within this class."}, {"start": 492.0, "end": 494.0, "text": "Therefore we can create a public member"}, {"start": 494.0, "end": 497.0, "text": "function and through that member"}, {"start": 497.0, "end": 500.0, "text": "function we can provide values to these"}, {"start": 500.0, "end": 502.0, "text": "variables."}, {"start": 502.0, "end": 505.0, "text": "Let''s define the public member function"}, {"start": 505.0, "end": 508.0, "text": "set student. Here you can observe these"}, {"start": 508.0, "end": 512.0, "text": "parameters n and r. n represents name"}, {"start": 512.0, "end": 516.0, "text": "and r represents role number. Whatever"}, {"start": 516.0, "end": 518.0, "text": "the values we receive here are also"}, {"start": 518.0, "end": 521.0, "text": "provided to name and role number"}, {"start": 521.0, "end": 523.0, "text": "variables which are private in this"}, {"start": 523.0, "end": 526.0, "text": "class. We can access them here in this"}, {"start": 526.0, "end": 529.0, "text": "function because this is the member"}, {"start": 529.0, "end": 533.0, "text": "function of this class. These variables"}, {"start": 533.0, "end": 536.0, "text": "are accessible within this class. That''s"}, {"start": 536.0, "end": 538.0, "text": "why providing name and role number in"}, {"start": 538.0, "end": 542.0, "text": "this function is perfectly valid."}, {"start": 542.0, "end": 545.0, "text": "Now we can call this function and"}, {"start": 545.0, "end": 548.0, "text": "provide values to these parameters."}, {"start": 548.0, "end": 550.0, "text": "For this purpose, we need to remove"}, {"start": 550.0, "end": 553.0, "text": "these two statements and write this"}, {"start": 553.0, "end": 555.0, "text": "specific statement."}, {"start": 555.0, "end": 558.0, "text": "Here through the S1 object, I am calling"}, {"start": 558.0, "end": 561.0, "text": "the set student function and I am"}, {"start": 561.0, "end": 564.0, "text": "passing these values to these"}, {"start": 564.0, "end": 566.0, "text": "parameters."}, {"start": 566.0, "end": 570.0, "text": "Now this means name will receive Bob and"}, {"start": 570.0, "end": 573.0, "text": "RO number will receive 101. So"}, {"start": 573.0, "end": 577.0, "text": "indirectly through the S1 object I am"}, {"start": 577.0, "end": 580.0, "text": "passing values to these private members."}, {"start": 580.0, "end": 583.0, "text": "I hope this is clear to you. We cannot"}, {"start": 583.0, "end": 586.0, "text": "directly access these members outside"}, {"start": 586.0, "end": 588.0, "text": "the class. But through the member"}, {"start": 588.0, "end": 593.0, "text": "function we can provide values to these"}, {"start": 593.0, "end": 594.0, "text": "members."}, {"start": 594.0, "end": 597.0, "text": "In this way we are providing restricted"}, {"start": 597.0, "end": 600.0, "text": "control to these members. And 